EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT

This Employment Agreement ("Agreement") is entered into on 15 January 2026 between ABC Technologies Pvt. Ltd., having its registered office at Bangalore, India ("Employer"), and John Smith, residing at 12 Green Street, Bangalore, India ("Employee").

1. Position
The Employee is hired as a Software Engineer and will report to the Engineering Manager.

2. Employment Term
The employment shall commence on 15 January 2026 and continue until terminated in accordance with this Agreement.

3. Compensation
The Employee shall receive an annual salary of INR 9,00,000, payable monthly.

4. Working Hours
The Employee shall work 40 hours per week from Monday to Friday.

5. Confidentiality
The Employee agrees not to disclose confidential information, trade secrets, source code, customer data, or proprietary business information to any third party during or after employment.

6. Intellectual Property
Any software, inventions, designs, or documents created during employment shall remain the sole property of the Employer.

7. Leave Policy
The Employee is entitled to 20 days of paid annual leave and 10 days of sick leave each calendar year.

8. Termination
Either party may terminate this Agreement by providing 30 days written notice.

9. Governing Law
This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of India.

10. Signatures

Employer:
ABC Technologies Pvt. Ltd.

Employee:
John Smith

Signed on: 15 January 2026